From 555c70b7b372b391e0ece37ff657cbcd8a725a3f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Johan=20Sellstr=C3=B6m?= <johan.sellstrom@iproov.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 10:02:43 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Propose NFCIsoDepReader: ISO-DEP access to eMRTD identity
 documents

Adds an NFCIsoDepReader / NFCIsoDepTag API restricted by UA-enforced
application policies. The only policy defined is for ICAO Doc 9303 eMRTDs:
the UA classifies a card before exposing it and filters plaintext command
APDUs so that only the eMRTD application can be selected. Also adds
terminology, a use case, an example, threats and security policies, and
hooks into visibility handling and release of NFC.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
