+    <section> <h4>ISO-DEP application policy</h4>
+      <p>
+        An {{NFCIsoDepReader}} MUST NOT expose a card to a page unless the
+        card has <a data-lt="classify a card">matched</a> an
+        <a>application policy</a> requested by the page, and the UA MUST
+        <a data-lt="check a command APDU">check every command APDU</a>
+        against that policy before sending it to the card.
+      </p>
+      <p>
+        Calling {{NFCIsoDepReader/scan()}} MUST require <a>transient
+        activation</a> and MUST <a>obtain permission</a>. The UA SHOULD name
+        the requested document type in the permission prompt, for instance
+        "read your passport or identity card chip".
+      </p>
+    </section>
